                    {
                      "id": "PRRC_kwDOOns7hc6BG8Nq",
                      "databaseId": 2166080362,
                      "author": {
                        "login": "omarbenhamid"
                      },
                      "body": "It is in general good to avoid creating new concepts, so I would create a concept of hooks only if it has an added value in regard to other well known options. I there something you can do with you can't do with standard django middleware or @ decorator ?",
                      "createdAt": "2025-06-25T08:09:02Z",
                      "updatedAt": "2025-06-25T08:50:19Z",
                      "url": "https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/23#discussion_r2166080362"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "PRRC_kwDOOns7hc6BHY6A",
                      "databaseId": 2166197888,
                      "author": {
                        "login": "Artui"
                      },
                      "body": "Sure - but Django middleware is not enough here. Or rather - it works just fine, but is completely disregarded. In this piece of code particularly\r\n<img width=\"864\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1b2e0cd-be90-4b53-a1c5-542aa5377cb2\" />\r\nonly `user` and `session` is copied from the DRF request into the MCP request. In our case, for example, we have eagerly loaded permissions (based on the context of request) and also some additional entity-specific data. Those are set on request via Django middleware - but those fields are lost when processing the request via _DRFRequestWrapper, because they are not copied properly. \r\nI don't think a decorator will work here - because _DRFRequestWrapper is so \"internal\" here",
                      "createdAt": "2025-06-25T08:58:01Z",
                      "updatedAt": "2025-06-25T09:55:55Z",
                      "url": "https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/23#discussion_r2166197888"
                    }
                  ],
                  "pageInfo": {
                    "hasNextPage": false,
                    "endCursor": "Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpK0MjAyNS0wNi0yNVQwODo1ODowMVrOgR2OgA=="
                  }
                }
              },
              {
